notes:
Lokale fix toegepast en geverifieerd met 'ddev drush cron' - geen errors meer. Productiefix vereist dezelfde state-opschoning:

ddev drush @prod ev '
$state = \Drupal::state();
foreach (["field.field.deleted", "field.storage.deleted"] as $key) {
  $items = $state->get($key, []);
  foreach ($items as $uuid => $def) {
    if ($def->getTargetEntityTypeId() === "comment") {
      unset($items[$uuid]);
    }
  }
  $state->set($key, $items);
}'

Daarna in prod DB:
- DROP TABLE field_deleted_data_41e50645a5, field_deleted_revision_41e50645a5 (als bestaat; verifieer eerst met SELECT COUNT(*) dat leeg is)
- DELETE FROM key_value WHERE collection='entity.definitions.bundle_field_map' AND name='comment';
- DELETE FROM key_value WHERE collection='entity.storage_schema.sql' AND name LIKE 'comment.%';
- DELETE FROM key_value WHERE collection='state' AND name='comment.maintain_entity_statistics';
- drush cr

